 font-medium">Request</span><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors shrink-0" aria-label="Copy curl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy w-3 h-3"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg> Copy</button></div><div class="p-3 bg-surface-3/50"><pre class="text-xs font-mono leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">curl</span> "<span class="text-amber-300/80">https://transcriptapi.com/api/v2/youtube/channel/latest?channel=@TED</span>" \
