n-all duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-4 pb-4"><div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground space-y-2"><p>Top-up credits last at least <strong>30 days</strong> from purchase, or until your current subscription period ends — whichever is later.</p><p>You'll need an <strong>active subscription</strong> to use them. If your subscription ends, your unused credits stay on your account but pause until you renew.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center"><p>Have custom requirements? <a href="/contact" class="text-info hover:underline">Contact us</a> for a custom plan.</p></div></section><section id="calculator" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Pricing Calculator" class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-24"><div class="space-y-3 text-center"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Estimate your bill</div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Pricing Calculator</h2><p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">Pick a plan and move the slider to see your total and effective cost per 1K.</p></div><div class="mt-8 flex justify-center"><div class="w-full max-w-2xl"><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6"><span class="text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calculator" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="14" y2="18"></line><path d="M16 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 10h.01"></path><path d="M8 10h.01"></path><path d="M12 14h.01"></path><path d="M8 14h.01"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M8 18h.01"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Pricing Calculator</h3></div><div class="space-y-6"><div><label class="text-sm font-medium mb-2 block">Select Plan</label><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button class="rounded-md border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-all border-border bg-surface-1 hover:bg-surface-3">Monthly</button><button class="rounded-md border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-all border-primary bg-primary text-primary-foreground">Annual</button></div></div><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><label class="text-sm font-medium">Monthly Transcript Volume</label><div class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">10,000</div></div><input type="range" min="0" max="100000" step="1000" class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-3 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer slider" aria-label="Monthly transcripts volume" value="10000"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><span>0</span><span>25k</span><span>50k</span><span>75k</span><span>100k</span></div></div><div class="space-y-3"><h4 class="text-sm font-medium">Monthly Cost Breakdown</h4><div class="space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-md bg-surface-1"><span class="text-sm">Plan cost</span><span class="font-medium">$4.50/mo</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-md bg-surface-1"><span class="text-sm">Top-ups (9K @ $1.5/1K)</span><span class="font-medium">$13.50</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-md bg-surface-3"><span class="font-medium">Total Monthly Cost</span><div class="text-right"><div class="text-xl font-bold">$18.00</div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="p-4 rounded-md bg-success/10 border-2 border-success/20 text-center"><div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-1">Effective cost per 1K transcripts</div><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-success">$1.80</div></div><a href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm7sL2h8cGHa3XgyT1Nu00" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-600/90 h-11 px-8 text-base w-full">Buy Annual Plan</a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions" class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-24"><div class="space-y-3 text-center"><div class="text-sm font-medium text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">FAQ</div><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">Short answers before you sign up.</p></div><div class="mt-8 flex justify-center"><div class="w-full max-w-2xl space-y-4"><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Is TranscriptAPI free?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">You can start for free: new accounts get 100 free credits, no card required, and one transcript costs one credit. After that, the paid plan is $5 a month for 1,000 credits per month, or $54 a year billed annually.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Is TranscriptAPI the same as youtubetranscriptapi?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">No. TranscriptAPI is a hosted REST API, separate from the open-source YouTubeTranscriptApi Python package, which fetches transcripts from your own machine. TranscriptAPI is managed and also adds YouTube search, channel browsing and playlist extraction.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Can I use it from Python or JavaScript?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Yes. TranscriptAPI is a REST API, so any language that can send an HTTPS request with a Bearer API key can call it, including Python and JavaScript with Node.js. The API reference includes complete code examples in cURL, Python and JavaScript.</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Quickstarts: <a href="/docs/getting-started/python/" class="text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400 underline">Python</a>, <a href="/docs/getting-started/javascript/" class="text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400 underline">JavaScript</a>, <a href="/docs/getting-started/curl/" class="text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-400 underline">cURL</a></p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Does it use my YouTube Data API quota?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">No. You sign in with your own TranscriptAPI credentials: an API key, or OAuth for some MCP clients. You do not need a Google or YouTube Data API key, so no YouTube Data API quota of yours is used. Usage is counted in TranscriptAPI credits instead.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-2 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Does it work with AI agents (MCP)?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Yes. TranscriptAPI runs an MCP server at https://transcriptapi.com/mcp. The MCP docs have setup guides for Claude and ChatGPT, which connect with OAuth, and OpenAI Agent Builder, which uses an API key. It works with any MCP-compatible client, and MCP calls use the same credits as the REST API.</p></div></div></div></section><footer class="border-t border-border mt-16"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="https://transcriptapi.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-foreground"><img src="/brand/logo.svg" alt="TranscriptAPI.com" height="24" width="24" class="rounded-sm"><span class="font-semibold">TranscriptAPI.com</span></a><span>© 2026</span></div><nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-foreground">Terms</a><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-foreground">Privacy</a><a href="/refund" class="hover:text-foreground">Refund</a><a href="/workflows" class="hover:text-foreground">Workflows</a><a href="/what-to-build" class="hover:text-foreground">What to build</a><a href="/docs/" class="hover:text-foreground">Docs</a><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-foreground">Contact</a></nav></div></footer></div></div></div>
